                           "method":  "POST",
                           "description":  "This API is used to add a subscriber. If the subscriber is in the **UNCONFIRMED** state, SMN sends a subscription confirmation message to the subscriber. After the subscriber clicks the subscription confirmation link, the subscriber\u0027s status changes to **CONFIRMED** and a subscription cancellation message is sent to the subscriber so that the subscriber can cancel the subscription at any time. After the subscriber clicks the unsubscription link, the subscriber\u0027s status changes to **CANCELED**, and a re-subscription message is sent to the subscriber so that the subscriber can subscribe again.",
